Akamai Connected Cloud OpenFang Quick Deploy App
Dashboard Access: SSH tunnel required (see details below)
Credentials File: /home/{{ username }}/.credentials
Documentation: https://www.linode.com/docs/marketplace-docs/guides/openfang/
*********************************************************

OpenFang listens on 127.0.0.1 only. To reach the dashboard, open an SSH
tunnel from your local machine:

  ssh -L 4200:127.0.0.1:4200 {{ username }}@{{ _domain }}

Then browse to: http://127.0.0.1:4200

On your first login as root, an onboarding prompt runs the interactive
'openfang init' wizard so you can configure your LLM provider and API key.

To delete this message of the day: rm /etc/motd
